Riskium licensing
=================

Copyright (c) 2026 Araz Saie Arasi, Hassan Haghighi, and Hossein Azgomi,
for their respective original contributions.

Original scientific content is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International (SPDX: CC-BY-4.0). This includes ontology/, requirements/,
diagrams/, docs/, evaluation/, references/ and root documentation/metadata,
except third-party material with its own notice.

Original software in tools/ and tests/, and repository build configuration,
is licensed under the MIT License (SPDX: MIT).

The licenses apply to distinct artifact scopes, not as alternative licenses
for the same file. A generated scientific artifact remains CC-BY-4.0 even
when its generator is MIT-licensed. Embedded code excerpts retain their
software license. Dependencies, third-party material and any separately
published manuscript retain their own terms.

Full license texts: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt and LICENSES/MIT.txt.
Scope, exclusions and attribution: RIGHTS.md and NOTICE.md.
Authors and affiliations: AUTHORS.md. Citation metadata: CITATION.cff.

